// Air Media: the work workerd cannot do (libheif, sharp, ffmpeg) runs in a
// Cloudflare Container behind this Worker. airv2-app calls it over HTTPS
// with a bearer token; the Worker authenticates and forwards to a container
// instance.
//
// Secrets (`wrangler secret put`, never here):
//   MEDIA_SERVICE_TOKEN   bearer shared with airv2-app
{
  "name": "air-media",
  "main": "src/index.ts",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-01",
  "compatibility_flags": ["nodejs_compat"],
  "workers_dev": true,
  "containers": [
    {
      "class_name": "MediaContainer",
      "image": "./container/Dockerfile",
      "instance_type": "standard-1",
      "max_instances": 4,
    },
  ],
  "durable_objects": {
    "bindings": [{ "name": "MEDIA", "class_name": "MediaContainer" }],
  },
  "migrations": [{ "tag": "v1", "new_sqlite_classes": ["MediaContainer"] }],
  "vars": { "MEDIA_INSTANCES": "2" },
  "observability": { "enabled": true },
}
